            "taught were",
            "was taught"
          ],
          "answer": 0,
          "note": "teach'in edilgeni."
        },
        {
          "type": "gap",
          "text": "___ she given any explanation?",
          "options": [
            "Was",
            "Did",
            "Has been"
          ],
          "answer": 0,
          "note": "Soruda be başa gelir."
        },
        {
          "type": "choice",
          "text": "Which passive does English usually prefer? ___",
          "options": [
            "She was given a prize.",
